Description: Tools for applying natural language processing (NLP)
    techniques to single-cell (sc) omics data. Uses term frequency-inverse
    document frequency (TF-IDF) to identify enriched terms in cell clusters,
    enabling harmonization of non-standardized cell-type labels across datasets
    and identification of metadata attributes over-represented in specific clusters.
